{"kind":"speech","actor":"mara","text":"All right—ninety each for the fifteenth, with the quarter still open. Please get yours to me a couple of days before; I can’t bridge it if it’s late. Twenty-seven each for standing charges sounds fair to me. With the usage, I don’t want to charge you as if you’d been here all along, but I don’t think taking all six weeks onto myself would be fair either."}
